{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "64470092-134b-80f2-92bb-0eafa383b367",
  "created_at": "2026-01-28T13:20:01-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Moira Brennan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:16:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:16:11-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Lorraine. Moira Brennan. Sorry, hang on one second, I'm feeding the woodstove and the door clangs when I shut it. [pause] Okay. There it is. Can you hear me all right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:16:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:16:29-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I grew up down by the harbor, and my father always said the first thing the plow does is bury the hydrant, never the sidewalk in front of the bar. Anyway, that's the long way to say I've got a hydrant buried near my house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:16:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a buried hydrant. Where is it exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:16:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm at 306 Rhode Island Avenue, up on the Hill. The hydrant is on my side of the street, just past my driveway, toward the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:17:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So 306 Rhode Island Avenue, hydrant on the same side just past the driveway. Is it covered from the plowing, or from the storm itself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:17:14-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both, I'd say. We got the snow Sunday into Monday, then it turned to rain. The plow came through Monday and pushed a wall of heavy stuff right over it. Now it's frozen up into a crust. I can't even see the top of the cap."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:17:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that wet snow gets heavy and then freezes hard. Has anyone from the fire department been out to dig it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:17:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not that I've seen. I haven't called them. I figured this was you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:17:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I'll put it in as a buried hydrant request and let the right people know. Can you tell me roughly how deep it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:17:59-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Maybe two feet of packed stuff on top. Chunky, with ice in it. I tried a shovel and it bounced."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:18:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, two feet, packed and icy. I'll note that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:18:13-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And while I have you, can I get sand? The street in front of my house is a sheet of ice now since the rain froze overnight. The slope by the corner is the worst."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:18:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, we can put that in. Is it the road you're worried about, or your own walkway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:18:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The road, mainly. The hill by the corner. Cars are sliding sideways. My walk I can handle myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:18:44-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So sand on Rhode Island Avenue near number 306, at the slope by the corner. I'll send that to the crew that handles sanding."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:18:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Will they come today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:18:59-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't give you a time. They work through the requests as they come in, and it's a busy week after that storm. But it's logged now with your address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:19:12-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That's fair."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:19:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want a call back, or is it fine to just leave it with the crews?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:19:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Leave it with them. Though if you need me, it's 401-555-0173."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:19:28-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read that back. 401-555-0173, Moira Brennan, 306 Rhode Island Avenue. Buried hydrant on your side past the driveway, and sand for the icy slope. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:19:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:19:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:19:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks, Lorraine. I'd better go close that stove door before the fire dies."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:19:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks for calling, Ms. Brennan. Stay warm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:19:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
